 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published. Per the strategy the start is the usual Profit set-up with Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol frozen, plus Wise Advice, Insurrection and Twilight Is Upon Me deployed with Heading For The Medical Frigate; several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "Event: the post's 'Belgian Grand Slam' is filed as [[2000 Brussels Grand Slam]] (11 August 2000, Sint-Agatha-Berchem, Belgium), the only Belgian Grand Slam 2000 event.",
  "Posted 'Yodas Hut' dested Dagobah: Yoda's Hut; 'Rendevous Point' Rendezvous Point; 'Lando in Millenium Falcon' Lando In Millennium Falcon; 'Wedge Antilles' is the Premiere card. Wise Advice is the original Dagobah Effect (no Defensive Shields existed in August 2000)."
 ],
 "player_note": "The post (27 August 2000) says: \"This is the deck that went undefeated in the European tournaments I played in, and in doing so got me second place in the Belgian Grand Slam (and the Dark Side uncut rares sheet)\"; the P.S. says the list was written up in Belgium.",
